WEBVTT

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.620
Honestly, that Chihiro...

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.690
Why did I have to get them...

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.720
Hurry up.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.030
Wait for me.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.470
I'm going to leave you behind.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.940
Don't!

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.530
Here you go.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.370
Oh, it looks delicious.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:29.580
How beautiful.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.130
Honestly, it smells great.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.210
I'm Saoji Ranko,

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.590
a second year student at Sanka Girls' Academy.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:40.470
My mother is the Saouji landlady of Kyoukaiseki.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:41.760
My father is the head chef.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:45.220
In other words, I am the daughter of this establishment.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.640
Ever since I was young, I would help out from time to time,

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.230
so at times when they are short-handed,

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:52.480
I'd conveniently be recruited.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.480
Thank you for your business.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:03.870
Come on, use your hands more efficiently.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:04.780
Who cares?

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.040
Don't suddenly interrupt me.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.660
l might cut my finger.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:11.250
Besides, why do I have to help out at your family's store?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.210
And it's finally Sunday as well...

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.800
Don't say things like that.

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.340
We've known each other for a long time, haven't we?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.380
Hey, you stopped working.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.930
You stopped me!

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.470
Aren't you the one doing what you want?

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.810
From what I can see, you two look like a well-matched couple.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.390
Mother!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.230
It's okay, Chihiro-kun.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.320
Even if you marry her, I won't tell you to take over the family business.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:37.980
Don't worry.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:41.570
If you get a chance, it's all right to push her down.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.570
Isn't that right, darling?

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.280
What are you saying, geez...

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.080
Hey!

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.960
Be more careful.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.710
Sorry, sorry.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.670
Oh, aren't you two hot?!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.890
You didn't have to let go of me so fast...

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.100
What?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.810
Nothing!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:26.780
I met Chihiro for the first time when we were in kindergarten.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:41.130
Unlike emotional dramas where they initially hate each other...

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:45.340
...but gradually fall in love as they get to know each other,

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:52.640
the first time we met was the best.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.520
Aren't you scared?

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.020
I'm not scared at all.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.240
I thought a prince had appeared.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:11.790
The next day, Uncle Don introduced me to that prince.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:17.000
Ranko-chan, this is my son Chihiro.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:20.170
He's a year younger than you, but please get along with each other.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.090
Yeah.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.420
Chihiro-kun.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.220
Huh?

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.680
Let's play.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.340
Sure...

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:33.100
I thought I would definitely get along with him.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.070
Are we watching a movie?

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.320
Yeah, it's interesting.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.960
What's wrong, Adriana?

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.630
Did you have a nightmare?

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.250
Adriana?

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.280
Chihiro-kun...

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.910
Chihiro-kun!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.080
What?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.540
Let's go outside.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.910
Why?

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.580
Let's play outside.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.210
Sounds boring.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.220
Let's go outside.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.890
Chihiro-kun, what do you normally do for fun?

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.600
Watch zombie movies.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.560
Other than zombie movies?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.400
Read zombie books.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.480
Other than zombies?

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.440
Eat food.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.070
That's not playing.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:16.580
How pretty!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:23.210
Chihiro-kun, let's use this and play house...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.800
What are you doing?

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.350
It's said that a dead body is buried underneath a sakura tree.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.560
Eh?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.390
A zombie may be buried here.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.740
Eh, let's stop.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.810
That stuff is scary.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.610
Hey, it's the priest's son, Chihiro.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.230
You're right.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:51.610
Wow, he's playing with a girl.

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.410
That's so lame!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:55.780
Since we wouldn't let him play with us,

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.830
he's playing with a girl.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.000
How disgusting!

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.080
What's with you guys?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.960
What's wrong with playing with a girl?

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:07.920
Chihiro-kun?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.180
Chihiro-kun!

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.640
He's crying again.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.010
He cries really easily, doesn't he?

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.770
Don't you think it's all right to let him cry all he wants?

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.360
My prospective prince was actually just a zombie loving weirdo...

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.860
...who gets tired of things easily and can't get along with other people.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.860
Nothing but a lame crybaby.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.700
He can stay calm in the graveyard only because...

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.120
...he's used to watching zombie movies,

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.500
and he's from a priest's family.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.040
So when it was time to go back,

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.840
my romantic feelings had completely cooled down.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.630
...can't do.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:55.140
No, you help us a lot every time we come here.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:55.840
Thank you so much.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:09:00.350
If it's okay with you, come here from time to time, and not just during the festival.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.680
Thank you very much.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.600
Oh, where is Yuzuna-san?

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:09.400
Mero has a fever, so Yuzuna took her to hospital.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.110
R-Really?!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.570
If so, it wasn't necessary to see us off.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.440
No, no.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.610
It's not that important.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.450
Well Nii-san, see you.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:24.730
Ranko, are you okay with not saying goodbye to Chihiro-kun?

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.460
It's fine.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:38.800
Geez... I was supposed to be helping in the kitchen,

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.310
so why do I have to deliver food as well?

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:44.060
It's because you didn't help much in the kitchen.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.770
That can't be helped.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:48.310
I don't usually cook.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.810
Yeah, that's true.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:54.570
Then why did you come along?

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:58.910
If you went alone, you wouldn't greet the customers properly.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.660
That'll affect my shop's reputation.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.740
It's not like I have no common sense.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.540
I can greet properly as well.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.830
Hey, Chihiro.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.370
Stop moaning and work properly.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.880
Ranko-chan, thank you for today's work as well.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.590
Not at all, it was nothing.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:19.130
You can use Chihiro as much as you want,

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.680
since you always take care of him.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.640
Thank you very much.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:27.060
Eh, don't I have the right to decline?

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:27.890
No.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:29.690
Hey, hey.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.860
How many more deliveries are there?

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:34.980
Two more.

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.130
What?

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:39.530
Are you that against helping out?

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.950
Not really the case, but...

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.620
I am worried about Rea.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.990
Oh, about Rea-san...

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:50.500
Hey, I've told you that it's not what you think.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.210
There are still a lot of things that we don't really know about,

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.250
like the stability of her condition.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.550
It's fine. I got it.

00:10:58.510 --> 00:10:59.300
I see.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.590
Can't take your mind off her, eh?

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.550
Rea-san is that cute, eh?

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.300
Th-

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.390
You totally don't understand.

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:09.560
Maybe those two are dating?

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.190
Is it really a date?

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:13.610
I-Is it a date?

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.570
Are you stupid?

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:15.980
There's no way it is.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.030
Wait a minute.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.650
You don't have to decline so bluntly.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.530
But this really isn't a date.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:22.340
What?!

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:25.240
Do you dislike the idea of dating me so much?

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.790
It's not like I dislike it.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:29.830
Wait, wait!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.710
Could this possibly be...

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:36.090
...what they call a lover's quarrel?

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.010
No, it's not.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:41.730
Damn you!

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:43.590
You get along with Rea-san... You get along with Ranko-san...

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.970
Why are you the only one who's popular?

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:49.730
What's more, you're only interested in crap like zombies.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:50.980
Surplus?

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.350
Is it a surplus?

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.350
Are you making a fool of me?

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.230
You are, aren't you?

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.400
Yasutaka-kun, calm down.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.360
As if I could calm down!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.240
I can't keep up with you...

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:05.740
Ranko-san, why do you like this guy?

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.530
He's not a sexy guy.

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:11.120
He's a rebellious, stubborn and good-for-nothing zombie otaku.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.000
That's true, I suppose...

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.130
You aren't going to deny it?

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.340
Besides, aren't you a perverted otaku who only goes after beautiful girls?

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.340
That's right.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:23.300
I take pride in that.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:26.090
That's why if you weren't so popular, I wouldn't be complaining.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.060
Like I said, I'm not popular.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:30.430
You're still saying that, you playboy.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.520
Calm down, you two.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.480
I am calm.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.810
I would meet Chihiro again...

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.650
...two years after our initial meeting.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.360
When I was around six,

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:49.410
Dad decided we would move from Chiba to here, Shiyou City.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.750
Our house was in the same neighbourhood as Chihiro's temple.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:56.630
And then, for a while my mother invited Chihiro over to play.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.540
Even though my love went cold two years ago,

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:03.630
he was my cousin, so I thought we could play together properly.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.470
Chihiro-kun.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.470
Hm?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.600
Let's play.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.220
How about a game or something?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.260
I won't play.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.390
Well, how about we go outside?

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.390
I won't go.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.480
He hasn't changed at all.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.980
Here, I brought some snacks.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:22.320
Chihiro-kun, since we finally moved into the neighbourhood,

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.490
please get along with Ranko.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.320
Ah, you're such a shy person.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:28.700
It's so cute.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:29.850
For some reason,
It's so cute.

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:32.370
Stop it.
my mother took an interest in Chihiro a long time ago.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:37.620
She told me to get along with Chihiro, which only made me feel worse.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:42.670
He really is cute, isn't he, Ranko?

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:50.930
Ah, Ranko.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.390
Where's Chihiro-kun?

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.810
Upstairs reading a book.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.980
Why don't you play with him?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.940
Because Chihiro-kun said he wouldn't play.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.280
He didn't want to play a game or go outside.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:11.700
Then go to the video rental store nearby.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.200
Huh?

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:16.120
You know, they have that anime you wanted to watch recently.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.170
Why don't you go rent that, and watch it together?

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:19.920
Eh?

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.250
Huh?

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:25.510
Is Ranko the type of kid who neglects her cousin?

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.010
I get it.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.430
It's over here.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.100
I know.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.270
Chihiro-kun.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.030
Hey, hey, Chihiro-kun.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:49.740
What?

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.700
Why don't we get an anime?

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.080
They have some interesting shows.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.910
These ones are interesting.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.210
Zombie Academy: The Tragedy at the Cultural Festival.

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:09.170
Ah, as expected of Chihiro-kun.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.180
If that's the case,

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:14.180
in the back I have a brand new film that I got from America.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:15.060
Do you want to see it?

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:16.180
I do!

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.980
Really, that Chihiro is amazing.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.020
He's only five years old,

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:26.940
and yet he watches horror films without subtitles.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.570
Here.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:34.120
It's a little extreme, so keep it a secret from your parents, okay?

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:34.990
Yeah.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.040
Hey, what did he mean by "extreme"?

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:40.910
He meant that the zombies are really "dero dero".

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:42.870
What's "dero dero"?

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.430
How would you express it?

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:48.550
Dero dero...

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.180
Why did you decide what we are watching on your own?

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:56.390
Don't worry, this is definitely interesting.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:59.390
This series is brilliant after all.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.020
I don't really like things like horror.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:05.270
But, if you watch it, you'll definitely come to like it.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.650
But, isn't it in English?

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:09.400
Even if you don't understand what they are saying, it's still interesting.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.110
I don't think it's interesting!

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.240
I wanted to watch an anime!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:19.740
Yeah, it's definitely better than an anime.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:22.830
I like anime more than horror.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.960
I'm exchanging this!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.590
Eh, Ranko-chan!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.970
Ranko-chan...

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.950
Go away.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.330
Chihiro-kun.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.720
Chihiro-kun, thank you for saving me.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.100
Thinking back,

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:31.190
I may have fallen in love at first sight when we first met in the graveyard.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.360
Would you stay with me?

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.860
Absolutely.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:38.110
And, since I was ten,
When this all ends, let's move in together.

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:41.240
there's no doubt that I'd already fallen in love with Chihiro.
Yes, please.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.460
Actually, Chihiro...

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.120
What?!

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:52.500
Chihiro, how would you want your first kiss to feel?

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:52.880
Okay then, how about up north?
Chihiro, how would you want your first kiss to feel?

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.800
Okay then, how about up north?

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.840
Ah? How it feels...
But, it's so cold.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:56.510
But, it's so cold.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.890
There are lots of different kinds, aren't there?

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:02.260
With a sunset beach as a background...

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:07.520
...or like a couple who are about to go their separate ways...

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.400
Um...

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:18.860
As I thought, I would love to kiss a zombie girl.

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:21.200
Zombie girls again?!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.870
Do you think something like that really exists?

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:27.250
There might be a chance that they do...

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.620
Think about it more seriously.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.250
Kissing is very important.

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:34.380
Okay, okay.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.010
Geez...

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:42.600
Furuya, you will be punished one day!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:45.520
Unless you introduce me to some cute girls...

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:48.230
Honestly, what an obstinate guy.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.600
So, let's go to the remaining two houses.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:52.560
Chihiro.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:53.900
Huh?

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.990
Let's hold hands.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.660
Why?

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:02.520
Don't ask.

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:03.450
Just hold my hand.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:04.280
It hurts... It hurts...

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:04.880
Okay, I got it.

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:05.950
I got it.

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.750
Then let's go.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.050
What is this?

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.380
Chihiro.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.510
What is it?

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:26.010
Do you remember the time we first held hands?

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:30.060
Wasn't it the first time we met?

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.980
You were crying in the graveyard,

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:35.690
so I had no other choice but to hold your hand.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.070
Or was it not like that?

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.440
What's the correct answer?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.450
I don't really remember a past event like that.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:46.790
Ah, what's up with you?

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.960
I don't understand your behaviour.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.170
Deliveries complete.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:58.130
You even deliver to a house like this?

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:58.550
Yeah.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.880
Ever since she had our lunch box at the funeral two years ago,

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.220
the old lady here has become a fan of our shop.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.430
She orders take-out from time to time.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:11.430
Your work is done.

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.100
You can go home now.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.690
Deliveries are complete anyway,

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:19.480
so there's no need to come back and help in our shop for now.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.400
There's enough manpower in our shop.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.570
Really?!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.700
Lucky!

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.570
See you.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:36.710
What's up?

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:40.550
What...

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.170
...are you doing?

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:03.360
Don't just go along with the mood and let someone kiss you.

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.110
Hah?

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.320
Think about it more seriously!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.780
Kissing is very important!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.640
As I thought,

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:37.310
I don't want to lose.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:49.320
I will definitely, definitely not lose...

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:44.860
Is it really all right to let me do the preview?

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:47.860
You have told Mero-chan about it, right?

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:51.360
In that case, it is fine.

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:53.730
Next time: Sankarea...

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:57.620
Episode 8: Fake... Freedom...

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:00.750
Eh... Mero-chan!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:04.270
Producer... Where is the producer?

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:05.680
Mero-chan, about that...

00:24:05.680 --> 00:24:09.710
Producer, can you explain what's going on here?
